  "goodToKnow": "Das Attentat is an assassination attempt or attack on a person: das Attentat auf John F. Kennedy, ein Attentat auf den Präsidenten. The most famous in German history is the 20 July 1944 Attentat on Hitler by Claus von Stauffenberg and others; it failed, and the conspirators were executed. Today the date is a day of remembrance for the resistance. Der Attentäter is the attacker. From French attentat (attempt). Plural: die Attentate."
